  "heading_path": [
    "Trade Marks Act 1995",
    "Part 7—Registration of trade marks",
    "Division 1—Initial registration",
    "73  Ceasing of registration"
  ],
  "instrument": "TMA1995",
  "kind": "section",
  "number": "73",
  "ref": "TMA1995/s73",
  "text": "The registration of a trade mark ceases if: (a) the trade mark is removed from the Register under section 78 or 80F or under Part 9; or (b) the registration of the trade mark is cancelled. Note: Section 84C explains the effect of revocation of the registration of a trade mark, applying some provisions as if the registration had ceased at a particular time (but for most purposes treating the registration as if it had never occurred).",
